	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0},\n{STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 4, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 5, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 6, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 8, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 9, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 12, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 13, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 14, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 15, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 16, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 17, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 18, 0}\fare not allowed to enter.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come holla at me when you ready.\nI’ll be right here. Standin’. Forever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the\nhomie {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Both Hustlers picked the homies\n{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\rTalk it out with your partner and\npick different homies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before I\nlet you in. That cool? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right this way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Look who back!\rI gotta save the game before you\npick up where you left off. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\rYou ain’t save before you dipped\nlast time.\rSo that run is DEAD. You\ndisqualified. Them the rules!\fI don’t make ’em. I just enjoy ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYYY, congrats!\rFor that W, we givin’ you this\nsouvenir print! Frame it!\fOr don’t. It’s your life.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Gold Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Silver Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SINGLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DOUBLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TAKE CHALLENGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One Hustler pick\n“BECOME LEADER.”\rThe other Hustler pick\n“JOIN GROUP.” {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We finna fire up DS Wireless\nCommunications. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before I\nlet you in. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen up!\rWin without your homies takin’\ndamage and you earn MORE CP.\fThe more, the better!\rLook at me. Took damage every\nscrap. I’m broke. I’m sleepin’ here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Listen!\rFace higher-level opps and you earn\nmore Castle Points.\rHigh risk, high reward!\nThat’s also how I lost my car.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Before every scrap, check the other\nside’s lineup.\rDon’t be cheap with your CP.\nLike the old sayin’ go...\r“Unless you run up in the opp’s\ntrap, you can’t take their pack.”\r...\fThat ain’t the right sayin’.\fThat’s a Gucci Mane bar.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Darach...\rHis feelings for Lady Caitlin all\nbottled up...\fHe make her tea every day. Every.\fDay. And she don’t even drink tea.\rOh, how I simp for HIM...\nIt’s a whole love triangle in here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At first, CP only good for healin’ HP.\rBut spend CP to rank up, and you\ncan heal PP too!\fIt’s like a loyalty program, but\fyou gotta win to keep it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you lose, ALL your CP go straight\nto ZERO!\rThat’s the Battle Castle rule.\nRun it up or lose it all.\fLike Vegas, but with a dress code.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0109_D32R0501_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dream is to wear a beautiful dress\nand live in a castle!\rThat ain’t what I meant to say...\rMy dream is to live in a castle with\nsomebody who wear a beautiful dress!\fBig difference! Big!\fOK it’s both. It’s both.</language>
	</row>
</body>
